            "review_text": "Vui99\nVietnam5 contributions\n0\nNgon luon\nSep 2025 • Friends\nIt impresses with its old country style, cozy and intimate. The fresh, hearty beef treats are especially good for meeting friends and family. Personally, the food was pretty good, the environment was comfortable, and the crowds were even better.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten February 24, 2026",
